		<div class="content-body">
			<main>
				<a id="top"></a>
				<div id="siteNotice"></div>
				<div class="mw-indicators">
				</div>
				<h1 id="firstHeading" class="firstHeading mw-first-heading"><span class="mw-page-title-main">Strength</span></h1>
				<div id="bodyContent" class="vector-body">
					<div id="siteSub" class="noprint">From Slay the Spire Wiki</div>
					<div id="contentSub"></div>
					<div id="contentSub2"></div>
					
					<div id="jump-to-nav"></div>
					<a class="mw-jump-link" href="#mw-head">Jump to navigation</a>
					<a class="mw-jump-link" href="#searchInput">Jump to search</a>
					<div id="mw-content-text" class="mw-body-content"><div class="mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output" lang="en" dir="ltr"><div class="game-tabber noexcerpt"><div class="game-tab" style="border: 2px solid var(--wiki-accent-color--hover); border-bottom: none;"><a class="mw-selflink selflink">Slay the Spire</a></div> <div class="game-tab"><a href="/wiki/Slay_the_Spire_2:Strength" title="Slay the Spire 2:Strength">Slay the Spire 2</a></div></div>
<div class="druid-infobox druid-container noexcerpt druid-container-small" id="druid-container-1"><div class="druid-section-container"><div class="druid-row druid-row-Title" data-druid-section-row="Main"><div class="druid-data druid-data-Title druid-data-nonempty druid-data-wide">
<a href="/wiki/File:Icon_Strength.png" class="image"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/30px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="30" height="30" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/45px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/60px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> Strength</div></div><div class="druid-row druid-row-StackType" data-druid-section-row="Main"><div class="druid-label druid-label-StackType">Stack Type</div><div class="druid-data druid-data-StackType druid-data-nonempty">
Intensity</div></div><div class="druid-row druid-row-Text" data-druid-section-row="Main"><div class="druid-data druid-data-Text druid-data-nonempty druid-data-wide">
Increases attack damage by X.</div></div></div></div>
<p><span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span> is a <a href="/wiki/Buff" class="mw-redirect" title="Buff">Buff</a> that increases the damage of <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Attack"><span>Attack cards</span></a></span> and  enemy <a href="/wiki/Intent" title="Intent">Intents</a>.
</p><p>Each point of <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span> increases the damage of an attack by 1. Attacks that hit multiple times, like <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Sword Boomerang" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Sword_Boomerang" title="Sword Boomerang"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Attack Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Common.png?260b96" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Common.png?260b96 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Sword_Boomerang" title="Sword Boomerang">Sword Boomerang</a></span>, will apply <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span> to each individual hit.
</p><p><span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span> can be negative, reducing the damage of attacks to a minimum of 0 damage per hit.
</p>
