<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Sources">Sources</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Strength?veaction=edit&amp;section=1" title="Edit section: Sources" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Strength?action=edit&amp;section=1" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Sources"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="On_Player">On Player</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Strength?veaction=edit&amp;section=2" title="Edit section: On Player" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Strength?action=edit&amp;section=2" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: On Player"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h3>
<h4><span class="mw-headline" id="Cards">Cards</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Strength?veaction=edit&amp;section=3" title="Edit section: Cards" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Strength?action=edit&amp;section=3" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Cards"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h4>
<ul><li><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Flex" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Flex" title="Flex"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Skill Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Skill_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Skill_Common.png?e5eaaf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Skill_Common.png?e5eaaf 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Flex" title="Flex">Flex</a></span> - Gain 2 (<span class="ts-positive">4</span>) <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>. At the end of turn, <span class="ts-negative">lose</span> 2 (<span class="ts-positive">4</span>) <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength Down" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength#Negative_Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon StrengthDown.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_StrengthDown.png/22px-Icon_StrengthDown.png?e0f5b9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_StrengthDown.png/33px-Icon_StrengthDown.png?e0f5b9 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_StrengthDown.png/44px-Icon_StrengthDown.png?e0f5b9 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Negative_Strength">Strength</a></span>.</li>
<li><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Inflame" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Inflame" title="Inflame"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Power Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Uncommon.png?4df1e4" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Uncommon.png?4df1e4 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Inflame" title="Inflame">Inflame</a></span> - Gain 2 (<span class="ts-positive">3</span>) <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>.</li>
<li><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Rupture" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Rupture" title="Rupture"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Power Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Uncommon.png?4df1e4" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Uncommon.png?4df1e4 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Rupture" title="Rupture">Rupture</a></span> - Gain 1 (<span class="ts-positive">2</span>) <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span> whenever you lose HP from a card.</li>
<li><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Spot Weakness" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Spot_Weakness" title="Spot Weakness"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Skill Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Skill_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Skill_Uncommon.png?64c48d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Skill_Uncommon.png?64c48d 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Spot_Weakness" title="Spot Weakness">Spot Weakness</a></span> - Gain 3 (<span class="ts-positive">4</span>) <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span> if the enemy intends to attack.</li>
<li><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Demon Form" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Demon_Form" title="Demon Form"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Power Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Rare.png?baa309" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Rare.png?baa309 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Demon_Form" title="Demon Form">Demon Form</a></span> - Gain 2 (<span class="ts-positive">3</span>) <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span> at the start of each turn.</li>
<li><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Limit Break" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Limit_Break" title="Limit Break"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Skill Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Skill_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Skill_Rare.png?78fe01" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Skill_Rare.png?78fe01 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Limit_Break" title="Limit Break">Limit Break</a></span> - Double your <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>.</li>
<li><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Reprogram" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Reprogram" title="Reprogram"><img alt="CardIcon Defect Skill Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Defect_Skill_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Defect_Skill_Uncommon.png?12d106" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Defect_Skill_Uncommon.png?12d106 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Reprogram" title="Reprogram">Reprogram</a></span> - Gain 1 (<span class="ts-positive">2</span>) <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>.</li>
<li><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Fasting" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Fasting" title="Fasting"><img alt="CardIcon Watcher Power Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Watcher_Power_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Watcher_Power_Uncommon.png?ca32e5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Watcher_Power_Uncommon.png?ca32e5 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Fasting" title="Fasting">Fasting</a></span> - Gain 3 (<span class="ts-positive">4</span>) <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>.</li>
<li><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Wish" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Wish" title="Wish"><img alt="CardIcon Watcher Skill Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Rare.png?ae356d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Rare.png?ae356d 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Wish" title="Wish">Wish</a></span> - Gain 3 (<span class="ts-positive">4</span>) <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>.</li>
<li><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="J.A.X." data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/J.A.X." title="J.A.X."><img alt="CardIcon Colorless Skill Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Common.png?9ab8b5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Common.png?9ab8b5 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/J.A.X." title="J.A.X.">J.A.X.</a></span> - Gain 2 (<span class="ts-positive">3</span>) <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>.</li></ul>
<h4><span class="mw-headline" id="Relics">Relics</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Strength?veaction=edit&amp;section=4" title="Edit section: Relics" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Strength?action=edit&amp;section=4" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Relics"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h4>
<ul><li><span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Vajra" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Vajra" title="Vajra"><img alt="Vajra.png" src="/images/thumb/Vajra.png/24px-Vajra.png?39bb77" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Vajra.png/36px-Vajra.png?39bb77 1.5x, /images/thumb/Vajra.png/48px-Vajra.png?39bb77 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Vajra" title="Vajra">Vajra</a></span> - Start each combat with 1 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>.</li>
<li><span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Shuriken" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Shuriken" title="Shuriken"><img alt="Shuriken.png" src="/images/thumb/Shuriken.png/24px-Shuriken.png?91b5e9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Shuriken.png/36px-Shuriken.png?91b5e9 1.5x, /images/thumb/Shuriken.png/48px-Shuriken.png?91b5e9 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Shuriken" title="Shuriken">Shuriken</a></span> - Gain 1 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span> for every 3 Attacks played in a turn.</li>
<li><span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Du-Vu Doll" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Du-Vu_Doll" title="Du-Vu Doll"><img alt="Du-VuDoll.png" src="/images/thumb/Du-VuDoll.png/24px-Du-VuDoll.png?1f9346" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Du-VuDoll.png/36px-Du-VuDoll.png?1f9346 1.5x, /images/thumb/Du-VuDoll.png/48px-Du-VuDoll.png?1f9346 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Du-Vu_Doll" title="Du-Vu Doll">Du-Vu Doll</a></span> - Start each combat with 1 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span> for each <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Curse"><span>Curse</span></a></span> in your Deck.</li>
<li><span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Girya" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Girya" title="Girya"><img alt="Girya.png" src="/images/thumb/Girya.png/24px-Girya.png?44e44f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Girya.png/36px-Girya.png?44e44f 1.5x, /images/thumb/Girya.png/48px-Girya.png?44e44f 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Girya" title="Girya">Girya</a></span> - Start each combat with 1 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span> for each time you used <b>Lift</b> at <a href="/wiki/Rest_Sites" title="Rest Sites">Rest Sites</a>, for a maximum of 3 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>.</li>
<li><span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Red Skull" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Red_Skull" title="Red Skull"><img alt="RedSkull.png" src="/images/thumb/RedSkull.png/24px-RedSkull.png?69d859" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/RedSkull.png/36px-RedSkull.png?69d859 1.5x, /images/thumb/RedSkull.png/48px-RedSkull.png?69d859 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Red_Skull" title="Red Skull">Red Skull</a></span> - Gain 3 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span> when you start combat with HP at 50% or less. Gain 3 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span> whenever your HP falls to 50% or less. <span class="ts-negative">Lose</span> 3 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span> whenever your HP rises above 50%.</li>
<li><span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Brimstone" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Brimstone" title="Brimstone"><img alt="Brimstone.png" src="/images/thumb/Brimstone.png/24px-Brimstone.png?1789d0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Brimstone.png/36px-Brimstone.png?1789d0 1.5x, /images/thumb/Brimstone.png/48px-Brimstone.png?1789d0 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Brimstone" title="Brimstone">Brimstone</a></span> - At the start of each turn, gain 2 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span> and all enemies gain 1 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>.</li>
<li><span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Sling of Courage" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Sling_of_Courage" title="Sling of Courage"><img alt="Sling.png" src="/images/thumb/Sling.png/24px-Sling.png?8257f9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Sling.png/36px-Sling.png?8257f9 1.5x, /images/thumb/Sling.png/48px-Sling.png?8257f9 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Sling_of_Courage" title="Sling of Courage">Sling of Courage</a></span> - Start each <a href="/wiki/Elite" class="mw-redirect" title="Elite">Elite</a> combat with 2 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>.</li>
<li><span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Mutagenic Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Mutagenic_Strength" title="Mutagenic Strength"><img alt="MutagenicStrength.png" src="/images/thumb/MutagenicStrength.png/24px-MutagenicStrength.png?86eb1e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/MutagenicStrength.png/36px-MutagenicStrength.png?86eb1e 1.5x, /images/thumb/MutagenicStrength.png/48px-MutagenicStrength.png?86eb1e 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Mutagenic_Strength" title="Mutagenic Strength">Mutagenic Strength</a></span> - Start each combat with 3 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>. At the end of your first turn, <span class="ts-negative">lose</span> 3 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength Down" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength#Negative_Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon StrengthDown.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_StrengthDown.png/22px-Icon_StrengthDown.png?e0f5b9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_StrengthDown.png/33px-Icon_StrengthDown.png?e0f5b9 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_StrengthDown.png/44px-Icon_StrengthDown.png?e0f5b9 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Negative_Strength">Strength</a></span>.</li></ul>
<h4><span class="mw-headline" id="Potions">Potions</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Strength?veaction=edit&amp;section=5" title="Edit section: Potions" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Strength?action=edit&amp;section=5" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Potions"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h4>
<ul><li><span class="inline-trigger potion-trigger" data-name="Flex Potion" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/File:FlexPotion.png" class="image"><img alt="FlexPotion.png" src="/images/thumb/FlexPotion.png/24px-FlexPotion.png?742e54" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/FlexPotion.png/36px-FlexPotion.png?742e54 1.5x, /images/thumb/FlexPotion.png/48px-FlexPotion.png?742e54 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Flex_Potion" title="Flex Potion">Flex Potion</a></span> - Gain 5 (<span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Sacred Bark" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark"><img alt="SacredBark.png" src="/images/thumb/SacredBark.png/24px-SacredBark.png?ea7218" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/SacredBark.png/36px-SacredBark.png?ea7218 1.5x, /images/thumb/SacredBark.png/48px-SacredBark.png?ea7218 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">10</a></span>) <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>. At the end of turn, <span class="ts-negative">lose</span> 5 (<span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Sacred Bark" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark"><img alt="SacredBark.png" src="/images/thumb/SacredBark.png/24px-SacredBark.png?ea7218" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/SacredBark.png/36px-SacredBark.png?ea7218 1.5x, /images/thumb/SacredBark.png/48px-SacredBark.png?ea7218 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">10</a></span>) <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength Down" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength#Negative_Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon StrengthDown.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_StrengthDown.png/22px-Icon_StrengthDown.png?e0f5b9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_StrengthDown.png/33px-Icon_StrengthDown.png?e0f5b9 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_StrengthDown.png/44px-Icon_StrengthDown.png?e0f5b9 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Negative_Strength">Strength</a></span>.</li>
<li><span class="inline-trigger potion-trigger" data-name="Strength Potion" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/File:StrengthPotion.png" class="image"><img alt="StrengthPotion.png" src="/images/thumb/StrengthPotion.png/24px-StrengthPotion.png?182d6f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/StrengthPotion.png/36px-StrengthPotion.png?182d6f 1.5x, /images/thumb/StrengthPotion.png/48px-StrengthPotion.png?182d6f 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strength_Potion" title="Strength Potion">Strength Potion</a></span> - Gain 2 (<span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Sacred Bark" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark"><img alt="SacredBark.png" src="/images/thumb/SacredBark.png/24px-SacredBark.png?ea7218" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/SacredBark.png/36px-SacredBark.png?ea7218 1.5x, /images/thumb/SacredBark.png/48px-SacredBark.png?ea7218 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">4</a></span>) <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>.</li>
<li><span class="inline-trigger potion-trigger" data-name="Cultist Potion" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/File:CultistPotion.png" class="image"><img alt="CultistPotion.png" src="/images/thumb/CultistPotion.png/24px-CultistPotion.png?ef0c3d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/CultistPotion.png/36px-CultistPotion.png?ef0c3d 1.5x, /images/thumb/CultistPotion.png/48px-CultistPotion.png?ef0c3d 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Cultist_Potion" title="Cultist Potion">Cultist Potion</a></span> - At the start of each turn, gain 1 (<span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Sacred Bark" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark"><img alt="SacredBark.png" src="/images/thumb/SacredBark.png/24px-SacredBark.png?ea7218" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/SacredBark.png/36px-SacredBark.png?ea7218 1.5x, /images/thumb/SacredBark.png/48px-SacredBark.png?ea7218 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">2</a></span>) <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>.</li></ul>
