<li><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Piercing Wail" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Piercing_Wail" title="Piercing Wail"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Skill Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Common.png?711671" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Common.png?711671 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Piercing_Wail" title="Piercing Wail">Piercing Wail</a></span> - All enemies <span class="ts-negative">lose</span> 6 (<span class="ts-positive">8</span>) <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>. At the end of turn, all enemies gain 6 (<span class="ts-positive">8</span>) <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Shackled" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength#Negative_Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Shackled.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Shackled.png/22px-Icon_Shackled.png?64b463" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Shackled.png/33px-Icon_Shackled.png?64b463 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Shackled.png/44px-Icon_Shackled.png?64b463 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Negative_Strength">Strength</a></span>.</li>
<li><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Malaise" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Malaise" title="Malaise"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Skill Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Rare.png?5a1724" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Rare.png?5a1724 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Malaise" title="Malaise">Malaise</a></span> - Enemy <span class="ts-negative">loses</span> X (<span class="ts-positive">X+1</span>) <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>.</li>
<li><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Dark Shackles" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Dark_Shackles" title="Dark Shackles"><img alt="CardIcon Colorless Skill Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Uncommon.png?8e5796" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Uncommon.png?8e5796 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Dark_Shackles" title="Dark Shackles">Dark Shackles</a></span> - Enemy <span class="ts-negative">loses</span> 9 (<span class="ts-positive">15</span>) <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>. At the end of turn, enemy gains 9 (<span class="ts-positive">15</span>) <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Shackled" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength#Negative_Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Shackled.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Shackled.png/22px-Icon_Shackled.png?64b463" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Shackled.png/33px-Icon_Shackled.png?64b463 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Shackled.png/44px-Icon_Shackled.png?64b463 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Negative_Strength">Strength</a></span>.</li></ul>
<h4><span class="mw-headline" id="Relics_2">Relics</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Strength?veaction=edit&amp;section=10" title="Edit section: Relics" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Strength?action=edit&amp;section=10" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Relics"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h4>
<ul><li><span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Philosopher&#39;s Stone" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Philosopher%27s_Stone" title="Philosopher&#39;s Stone"><img alt="PhilosophersStone.png" src="/images/thumb/PhilosophersStone.png/24px-PhilosophersStone.png?28b31d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/PhilosophersStone.png/36px-PhilosophersStone.png?28b31d 1.5x, /images/thumb/PhilosophersStone.png/48px-PhilosophersStone.png?28b31d 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Philosopher%27s_Stone" title="Philosopher&#39;s Stone">Philosopher's Stone</a></span> - Enemies start each combat with 1 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>.</li>
<li><span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Brimstone" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Brimstone" title="Brimstone"><img alt="Brimstone.png" src="/images/thumb/Brimstone.png/24px-Brimstone.png?1789d0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Brimstone.png/36px-Brimstone.png?1789d0 1.5x, /images/thumb/Brimstone.png/48px-Brimstone.png?1789d0 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Brimstone" title="Brimstone">Brimstone</a></span> - At the start of your turn, gain 2 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span> and ALL enemies gain 1 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>.</li></ul>
