<ul><li>Starts combat with <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength Up" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orb_Walker" title="Orb Walker"><img alt="Icon Stasis.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Stasis.png/22px-Icon_Stasis.png?3aa3ed" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Stasis.png/33px-Icon_Stasis.png?3aa3ed 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Stasis.png/44px-Icon_Stasis.png?3aa3ed 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Orb_Walker" title="Orb Walker">Strength Up</a></span> - Gain 3 (<span class="inline-trigger ascension-trigger" data-name="17" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension">5</a><sup><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension"><img alt="Ascension.png" src="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/18px-Ascension.png?bb884e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/27px-Ascension.png?bb884e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Ascension.png/36px-Ascension.png?bb884e 2x" data-file-width="43" data-file-height="43" /></a> <span class="ascension-superscript">17</span></sup></span>) <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span> each turn.</li></ul></li>
