<ul><li>Starts combat with <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Shifting" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Transient" title="Transient"><img alt="Icon Shifting.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Shifting.png/22px-Icon_Shifting.png?7c054b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Shifting.png/33px-Icon_Shifting.png?7c054b 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Shifting.png/44px-Icon_Shifting.png?7c054b 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Transient" title="Transient">Shifting</a></span> - Losing HP also <span class="ts-negative">reduces</span> that much <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>. At the end of turn, gain all that lost <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Shackled" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength#Negative_Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Shackled.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Shackled.png/22px-Icon_Shackled.png?64b463" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Shackled.png/33px-Icon_Shackled.png?64b463 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Shackled.png/44px-Icon_Shackled.png?64b463 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Negative_Strength">Strength</a></span> back.</li></ul></li></ul>
<h4><span class="mw-headline" id="Elites_2">Elites</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Strength?veaction=edit&amp;section=12" title="Edit section: Elites" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Strength?action=edit&amp;section=12" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Elites"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h4>
<ul><li>The <a href="/wiki/Elites#Super_Elites" title="Elites">Super Elite</a> may start combat with 2/3/4 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span> in Act 1/2/3.</li>
<li><span class="enemy-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Gremlin Nob" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Gremlin_Nob#Gremlin_Nob" title="Gremlin Nob"><img alt="EliteClear.png" src="/images/thumb/EliteClear.png/22px-EliteClear.png?9888cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/EliteClear.png/33px-EliteClear.png?9888cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/EliteClear.png/44px-EliteClear.png?9888cd 2x" data-file-width="106" data-file-height="106" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Gremlin_Nob#Gremlin_Nob" title="Gremlin Nob">Gremlin Nob</a></span>
<ul><li><span class="intent-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Gremlin Nob#Bellow" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/File:Intent_Buff.png" class="image"><img alt="Intent Buff.png" src="/images/thumb/Intent_Buff.png/22px-Intent_Buff.png?935c92" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Intent_Buff.png/33px-Intent_Buff.png?935c92 1.5x, /images/thumb/Intent_Buff.png/44px-Intent_Buff.png?935c92 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Gremlin_Nob" title="Gremlin Nob">Bellow</a></span> - Gain 2 (<span class="inline-trigger ascension-trigger" data-name="18" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension">3</a><sup><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension"><img alt="Ascension.png" src="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/18px-Ascension.png?bb884e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/27px-Ascension.png?bb884e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Ascension.png/36px-Ascension.png?bb884e 2x" data-file-width="43" data-file-height="43" /></a> <span class="ascension-superscript">18</span></sup></span>) <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span> whenever an Attack is played.</li></ul></li>
<li><span class="enemy-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Gremlin Leader" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Gremlin_Leader#Gremlin_Leader" title="Gremlin Leader"><img alt="EliteClear.png" src="/images/thumb/EliteClear.png/22px-EliteClear.png?9888cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/EliteClear.png/33px-EliteClear.png?9888cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/EliteClear.png/44px-EliteClear.png?9888cd 2x" data-file-width="106" data-file-height="106" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Gremlin_Leader#Gremlin_Leader" title="Gremlin Leader">Gremlin Leader</a></span>
<ul><li><span class="intent-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Gremlin Leader#Encourage" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/File:Intent_DefendBuff.png" class="image"><img alt="Intent DefendBuff.png" src="/images/thumb/Intent_DefendBuff.png/22px-Intent_DefendBuff.png?41c7b9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Intent_DefendBuff.png/33px-Intent_DefendBuff.png?41c7b9 1.5x, /images/thumb/Intent_DefendBuff.png/44px-Intent_DefendBuff.png?41c7b9 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Gremlin_Leader" title="Gremlin Leader">Encourage</a></span> - All enemies gain 3 (<span class="inline-trigger ascension-trigger" data-name="3" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension">4</a><sup><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension"><img alt="Ascension.png" src="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/18px-Ascension.png?bb884e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/27px-Ascension.png?bb884e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Ascension.png/36px-Ascension.png?bb884e 2x" data-file-width="43" data-file-height="43" /></a> <span class="ascension-superscript">3</span></sup></span>, <span class="inline-trigger ascension-trigger" data-name="18" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension">5</a><sup><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension"><img alt="Ascension.png" src="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/18px-Ascension.png?bb884e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/27px-Ascension.png?bb884e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Ascension.png/36px-Ascension.png?bb884e 2x" data-file-width="43" data-file-height="43" /></a> <span class="ascension-superscript">18</span></sup></span>) <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon