<li>Starts combat with <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Curiosity" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Awakened_One" title="Awakened One"><img alt="Icon Curiosity.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Curiosity.png/22px-Icon_Curiosity.png?bf62a9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Curiosity.png/33px-Icon_Curiosity.png?bf62a9 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Curiosity.png/44px-Icon_Curiosity.png?bf62a9 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Awakened_One" title="Awakened One">Curiosity</a></span> - Gain 1 (<span class="inline-trigger ascension-trigger" data-name="19" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension">2</a><sup><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension"><img alt="Ascension.png" src="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/18px-Ascension.png?bb884e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/27px-Ascension.png?bb884e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Ascension.png/36px-Ascension.png?bb884e 2x" data-file-width="43" data-file-height="43" /></a> <span class="ascension-superscript">19</span></sup></span>) <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span> whenever a Power is played.</li>
<li>Removes all negative <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span> whenever HP reaches 0.</li></ul></li>
<li><span class="enemy-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Time Eater" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Time_Eater#Time_Eater" title="Time Eater"><img alt="Map-TimeEater.png" src="/images/thumb/Map-TimeEater.png/22px-Map-TimeEater.png?74ceb5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Map-TimeEater.png/33px-Map-TimeEater.png?74ceb5 1.5x, /images/thumb/Map-TimeEater.png/44px-Map-TimeEater.png?74ceb5 2x" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="512" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Time_Eater#Time_Eater" title="Time Eater">Time Eater</a></span>
<ul><li>Starts combat with <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Time Warp" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Time_Eater" title="Time Eater"><img alt="Icon TimeWarp.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_TimeWarp.png/22px-Icon_TimeWarp.png?2c6fb1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_TimeWarp.png/33px-Icon_TimeWarp.png?2c6fb1 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_TimeWarp.png/44px-Icon_TimeWarp.png?2c6fb1 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Time_Eater" title="Time Eater">Time Warp</a></span> - Gain 2 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span> whenever 12 cards are played.</li></ul></li>
<li><span class="enemy-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Donu" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Donu_and_Deca#Donu" title="Donu and Deca"><img alt="Map-DonuDeca.png" src="/images/thumb/Map-DonuDeca.png/22px-Map-DonuDeca.png?a007ef" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Map-DonuDeca.png/33px-Map-DonuDeca.png?a007ef 1.5x, /images/thumb/Map-DonuDeca.png/44px-Map-DonuDeca.png?a007ef 2x" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="512" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Donu_and_Deca#Donu" title="Donu and Deca">Donu</a></span>
<ul><li><span class="intent-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Donu#Circle of Power" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/File:Intent_Buff.png" class="image"><img alt="Intent Buff.png" src="/images/thumb/Intent_Buff.png/22px-Intent_Buff.png?935c92" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Intent_Buff.png/33px-Intent_Buff.png?935c92 1.5x, /images/thumb/Intent_Buff.png/44px-Intent_Buff.png?935c92 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Donu_and_Deca#Donu" title="Donu and Deca">Circle of Power</a></span> - All enemies gain 3 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>.</li></ul></li>
<li><span class="enemy-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Corrupt Heart" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Corrupt_Heart#Corrupt_Heart" title="Corrupt Heart"><img alt="Map-CorruptHeart.png" src="/images/thumb/Map-CorruptHeart.png/22px-Map-CorruptHeart.png?9f6024" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Map-CorruptHeart.png/33px-Map-CorruptHeart.png?9f6024 1.5x, /images/thumb/Map-CorruptHeart.png/44px-Map-CorruptHeart.png?9f6024 2x" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="512" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Corrupt_Heart#Corrupt_Heart" title="Corrupt Heart">Corrupt Heart</a></span>
<ul><li><span class="intent-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Corrupt Heart#Buff" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/File:Intent_Buff.png" class="image"><img alt="Intent Buff.png" src="/images/thumb/Intent_Buff.png/22px-Intent_Buff.png?935c92" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Intent_Buff.png/33px-Intent_Buff.png?935c92 1.5x, /images/thumb/Intent_Buff.png/44px-Intent_Buff.png?935c92 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Corrupt_Heart" title="Corrupt Heart">Buff</a></span> - Remove all negative <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>. Gain 2 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>. If it's the 13th turn, gain 10 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>. If it's the 16th turn, gain 50 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>.</li></ul></li></ul>
<h4><span class="mw-headline" id="Other_2">Other</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Strength?veaction=edit&amp;section=14" title="Edit section: Other" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Strength?action=edit&amp;section=14" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Other"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h4>
<ul><li><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Lethality" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Custom_Mode#Lethality" title="Custom Mode"><img alt="Mod LethalEnemies.png" src="/images/thumb/Mod_LethalEnemies.png/18px-Mod_LethalEnemies.png?efa39e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Mod_LethalEnemies.png/27px-Mod_LethalEnemies.png?efa39e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Mod_LethalEnemies.png/36px-Mod_LethalEnemies.png?efa39e 2x" data-file-width="56" data-file-height="56" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Custom_Mode#Lethality" title="Custom Mode">Lethality</a></span> - Everyone starts combat with 3 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>.</li></ul>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Interactions">Interactions</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Strength?veaction=edit&amp;section=15" title="Edit section: Interactions" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Strength?action=edit&amp;section=15" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Interactions"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2><div class="druid-infobox druid-container noexcerpt druid-container-small" id="druid-container-2"><div class="druid-section-container"><div class="druid-row druid-row-Title" data-druid-section-row="Main"><div class="druid-data druid-data-Title druid-data-nonempty druid-data-wide">
<a href="/wiki/File:Icon_StrengthDown.png" class="image"><img alt="Icon StrengthDown.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_StrengthDown.png/30px-Icon_StrengthDown.png?e0f5b9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="30" height="30" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_StrengthDown.png/45px-Icon_StrengthDown.png?e0f5b9 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_StrengthDown.png/60px-Icon_StrengthDown.png?e0f5b9 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> Strength Down<div class="infobox-edit-button"><a href="/wiki/Module:Powers/data" title="Module:Powers/data"><img alt="ModuleEditIcon.png" src="/images/thumb/ModuleEditIcon.png/28px-ModuleEditIcon.png?d0f77e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28" srcset="/images/thumb/ModuleEditIcon.png/42px-ModuleEditIcon.png?d0f77e 1.5x, /images/thumb/ModuleEditIcon.png/56px-ModuleEditIcon.png?d0f77e 2x" data-file-width="202" data-file-height="202" /></a></div></div></div><div class="druid-row druid-row-StackType" data-druid-section-row="Main"><div class="druid-label druid-label-StackType">Stack Type</div><div class="druid-data druid-data-StackType druid-data-nonempty">
Intensity</div></div><div class="druid-row druid-row-Text" data-druid-section-row="Main"><div class="druid-data druid-data-Text druid-data-nonempty druid-data-wide">
At the end of this turn, lose X $Strength.</div></div></div></div><div class="druid-infobox druid-container noexcerpt druid-container-small" id="druid-container-3"><div class="druid-section-container"><div class="druid-row druid-row-Title" data-druid-section-row="Main"><div class="druid-data druid-data-Title druid-data-nonempty druid-data-wide">
<a href="/wiki/File:Icon_Shackled.png" class="image"><img alt="Icon Shackled.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Shackled.png/30px-Icon_Shackled.png?64b463" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="30" height="30" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Shackled.png/45px-Icon_Shackled.png?64b463 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Shackled.png/60px-Icon_Shackled.png?64b463 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> Shackled<div class="infobox-edit-button"><a href="/wiki/Module:Powers/data" title="Module:Powers/data"><img alt="ModuleEditIcon.png" src="/images/thumb/ModuleEditIcon.png/28px-ModuleEditIcon.png?d0f77e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28" srcset="/images/thumb/ModuleEditIcon.png/42px-ModuleEditIcon.png?d0f77e 1.5x, /images/thumb/ModuleEditIcon.png/56px-ModuleEditIcon.png?d0f77e 2x" data-file-width="202" data-file-height="202" /></a></div></div></div><div class="druid-row druid-row-StackType" data-druid-section-row="Main"><div class="druid-label druid-label-StackType">Stack Type</div><div class="druid-data druid-data-StackType druid-data-nonempty">
Intensity</div></div><div class="druid-row druid-row-Text" data-druid-section-row="Main"><div class="druid-data druid-data-Text druid-data-nonempty druid-data-wide">
At the end of its turn, gains X $Strength.</div></div></div></div>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Order">Order</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Strength?veaction=edit&amp;section=16" title="Edit section: Order" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Strength?action=edit&amp;section=16" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Order"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h3>
<ul><li><span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span> is applied <b>before</b> multiplicative effects like <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Vulnerable" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable"><img alt="Icon Vulnerable.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/22px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/33px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/44px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable">Vulnerable</a></span>.
<ul><li>For example, if you have 2 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span> and play <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strike (Ironclad)" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strike_(Ironclad)" title="Strike (Ironclad)"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Attack Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Common.png?260b96" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Common.png?260b96 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strike_(Ironclad)" title="Strike (Ironclad)">Strike</a></span> on a <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Vulnerable" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable"><img alt="Icon Vulnerable.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/22px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/33px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/44px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable">Vulnerable</a></span> target, you will deal <b>12</b> damage ((6+2)×1.5) instead of <b>11</b> damage ((6×1.5)+2).</li>
<li>Multiplicative effects are <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Vulnerable" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable"><img alt="Icon Vulnerable.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/22px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/33px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/44px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable">Vulnerable</a></span>, <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Weak" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Weak" title="Weak"><img alt="Icon Weak.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/22px-Icon_Weak.png?261352" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/33px-Icon_Weak.png?261352 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/44px-Icon_Weak.png?261352 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Weak" title="Weak">Weak</a></span>, <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Wrath" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Stance" title="Keywords">Wrath</a></span>, <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Divinity" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Stance" title="Keywords">Divinity</a></span>, <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Phantasmal Killer" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Phantasmal_Killer" title="Phantasmal Killer"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Skill Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Rare.png?5a1724" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Rare.png?5a1724 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Phantasmal_Killer" title="Phantasmal Killer">Phantasmal Killer</a></span>, <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Pen Nib" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Pen_Nib" title="Pen Nib"><img alt="PenNib.png" src="/images/thumb/PenNib.png/24px-PenNib.png?3d858e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/PenNib.png/36px-PenNib.png?3d858e 1.5x, /images/thumb/PenNib.png/48px-PenNib.png?3d858e 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Pen_Nib" title="Pen Nib">Pen Nib</a></span>, <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Slow" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Giant_Head" title="Giant Head"><img alt="Icon Slow.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Slow.png/22px-Icon_Slow.png?c1df05" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Slow.png/33px-Icon_Slow.png?c1df05 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Slow.png/44px-Icon_Slow.png?c1df05 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Giant_Head" title="Giant Head">Slow</a></span>, <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Surrounded" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Spire_Shield_and_Spire_Spear" title="Spire Shield and Spire Spear"><img alt="Icon Surrounded.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Surrounded.png/22px-Icon_Surrounded.png?a37856" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Surrounded.png/33px-Icon_Surrounded.png?a37856 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Surrounded.png/44px-Icon_Surrounded.png?a37856 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Spire_Shield_and_Spire_Spear" title="Spire Shield and Spire Spear">Surrounded</a></span> and <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Spear of Blight" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Spear_of_Blight" title="Spear of Blight"><img alt="BlightSpear.png" src="/images/thumb/BlightSpear.png/24px-BlightSpear.png?b5e050" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/BlightSpear.png/36px-BlightSpear.png?b5e050 1.5x, /images/thumb/BlightSpear.png/48px-BlightSpear.png?b5e050 2x" data-file-width="92" data-file-height="92" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Spear_of_Blight" class="mw-redirect" title="Spear of Blight">Spear of Blight</a></span>.</li></ul></li></ul>
<ul><li><span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Vigor" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Vigor" title="Vigor"><img alt="Icon Vigor.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Vigor.png/22px-Icon_Vigor.png?f2e384" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Vigor.png/33px-Icon_Vigor.png?f2e384 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Vigor.png/44px-Icon_Vigor.png?f2e384 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Vigor" title="Vigor">Vigor</a></span>, <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Accuracy" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Accuracy" title="Accuracy"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Power Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Power_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Power_Uncommon.png?7d7f97" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Power_Uncommon.png?7d7f97 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Accuracy" title="Accuracy">Accuracy</a></span>, <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strike Dummy" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strike_Dummy" title="Strike Dummy"><img alt="StrikeDummy.png" src="/images/thumb/StrikeDummy.png/24px-StrikeDummy.png?8d3dda" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/StrikeDummy.png/36px-StrikeDummy.png?8d3dda 1.5x, /images/thumb/StrikeDummy.png/48px-StrikeDummy.png?8d3dda 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strike_Dummy" title="Strike Dummy">Strike Dummy</a></span> and <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Wrist Blade" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Wrist_Blade" title="Wrist Blade"><img alt="WristBlade.png" src="/images/thumb/WristBlade.png/24px-WristBlade.png?942016" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/WristBlade.png/36px-WristBlade.png?942016 1.5x, /images/thumb/WristBlade.png/48px-WristBlade.png?942016 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Wrist_Blade" title="Wrist Blade">Wrist Blade</a></span> work exactly like <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span> and stack additively.</li></ul>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="What_works_with_Strength">What works with Strength</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Strength?veaction=edit&amp;section=17" title="Edit section: What works with Strength" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Strength?action=edit&amp;section=17" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: What works with Strength"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h3>
<ul><li>Damaging <a href="/wiki/Relics" title="Relics">Relics</a> and <a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs">Orbs</a> do not interact with <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>.</li></ul>
<ul><li>Only <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Attack"><span>Attack</span></a></span> cards can benefit from <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>
<ul><li>For example, <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Combust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Combust" title="Combust"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Power Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Uncommon.png?4df1e4" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Uncommon.png?4df1e4 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Combust" title="Combust">Combust</a></span>, <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Corpse Explosion" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Corpse_Explosion" title="Corpse Explosion"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Skill Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Rare.png?5a1724" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Rare.png?5a1724 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Corpse_Explosion" title="Corpse Explosion">Corpse Explosion</a></span>, <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Electrodynamics" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Electrodynamics" title="Electrodynamics"><img alt="CardIcon Defect Power Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Defect_Power_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Defect_Power_Rare.png?a9e6d3" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Defect_Power_Rare.png?a9e6d3 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Electrodynamics" title="Electrodynamics">Electrodynamics</a></span>, <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Omega" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Alpha" title="Alpha"><img alt="CardIcon Colorless Power Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Colorless_Power_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Colorless_Power_Common.png?87624f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Colorless_Power_Common.png?87624f 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Alpha" title="Alpha">Omega</a></span> and <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="The Bomb" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/The_Bomb" title="The Bomb"><img alt="CardIcon Colorless Skill Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Rare.png?4bfc4b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Rare.png?4bfc4b 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/The_Bomb" title="The Bomb">The Bomb</a></span> do <b>not</b> work with <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>.</li></ul></li></ul>
<ul><li>Direct removal of HP does not count as damage, and thus do not benefit from <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>.
<ul><li>The secondary effects of <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Hemokinesis" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Hemokinesis" title="Hemokinesis"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Attack Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Uncommon.png?d4e46d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Uncommon.png?d4e46d 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Hemokinesis" title="Hemokinesis">Hemokinesis</a></span>, <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Poisoned Stab" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Poisoned_Stab" title="Poisoned Stab"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Attack Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Common.png?ba66ad" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Common.png?ba66ad 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Poisoned_Stab" title="Poisoned Stab">Poisoned Stab</a></span> and <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Choke" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Choke" title="Choke"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Attack Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Uncommon.png?280c75" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Uncommon.png?280c75 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Choke" title="Choke">Choke</a></span> are completely unnafected by <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>.</li></ul></li></ul>
<ul><li>Attacks that deal 0 damage, like <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Body Slam" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Body_Slam" title="Body Slam"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Attack Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Common.png?260b96" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Common.png?260b96 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Body_Slam" title="Body Slam">Body Slam</a></span> used with no <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span>, will deal nonzero damage if you have <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>.</li></ul>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Negative_Strength">Negative Strength</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Strength?veaction=edit&amp;section=18" title="Edit section: Negative Strength" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Strength?action=edit&amp;section=18" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Negative Strength"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h3>
<ul><li>Negative <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>, <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength Down" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength#Negative_Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon StrengthDown.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_StrengthDown.png/22px-Icon_StrengthDown.png?e0f5b9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_StrengthDown.png/33px-Icon_StrengthDown.png?e0f5b9 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_StrengthDown.png/44px-Icon_StrengthDown.png?e0f5b9 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Negative_Strength">Strength Down</a></span> and <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Shackled" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength#Negative_Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Shackled.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Shackled.png/22px-Icon_Shackled.png?64b463" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Shackled.png/33px-Icon_Shackled.png?64b463 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Shackled.png/44px-Icon_Shackled.png?64b463 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Negative_Strength">Shackled</a></span> are <a href="/wiki/Debuffs" title="Debuffs">Debuffs</a>, and thus they can be blocked by <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Artifact" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Artifact" title="Artifact"><img alt="Icon Artifact.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/22px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/33px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/44px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Artifact" title="Artifact">Artifact</a></span> or removed with <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Orange Pellets" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orange_Pellets" title="Orange Pellets"><img alt="OrangePellets.png" src="/images/thumb/OrangePellets.png/24px-OrangePellets.png?bbb2d1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/OrangePellets.png/36px-OrangePellets.png?bbb2d1 1.5x, /images/thumb/OrangePellets.png/48px-OrangePellets.png?bbb2d1 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Orange_Pellets" title="Orange Pellets">Orange Pellets</a></span>.</li></ul>
<ul><li>Losing <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span> is always treated as gaining a <a href="/wiki/Debuff" class="mw-redirect" title="Debuff">Debuff</a>, even if you would still end up with a positive value.</li></ul>
<ul><li>Attacks that deal 0 damage will trigger on-attack effects like <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Thorns" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Buffs#Thorns" title="Buffs"><img alt="Icon Thorns.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Thorns.png/22px-Icon_Thorns.png?8d2a8b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Thorns.png/33px-Icon_Thorns.png?8d2a8b 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Thorns.png/44px-Icon_Thorns.png?8d2a8b 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Buffs#Thorns" title="Buffs">Thorns</a></span>, but not on-damage effects like <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Malleable" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Malleable" title="Malleable"><img alt="Icon Malleable.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Malleable.png/22px-Icon_Malleable.png?2f5f2d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Malleable.png/33px-Icon_Malleable.png?2f5f2d 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Malleable.png/44px-Icon_Malleable.png?2f5f2d 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Malleable" title="Malleable">Malleable</a></span>.</li></ul>
<ul><li><span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span> is capped between -999 and 999.</li></ul>
<div style="clear:both;" class=""></div>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Hints">Hints</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Strength?veaction=edit&amp;section=19" title="Edit section: Hints" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Strength?action=edit&amp;section=19" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Hints"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="General">General</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Strength?veaction=edit&amp;section=20" title="Edit section: General" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Strength?action=edit&amp;section=20" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: General"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h3>
<ul><li>Expensive and slow sources of <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>, like <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Demon Form" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Demon_Form" title="Demon Form"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Power Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Rare.png?baa309" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Rare.png?baa309 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Demon_Form" title="Demon Form">Demon Form</a></span>, <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Reprogram" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Reprogram" title="Reprogram"><img alt="CardIcon Defect Skill Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Defect_Skill_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Defect_Skill_Uncommon.png?12d106" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Defect_Skill_Uncommon.png?12d106 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Reprogram" title="Reprogram">Reprogram</a></span> and <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Shuriken" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Shuriken" title="Shuriken"><img alt="Shuriken.png" src="/images/thumb/Shuriken.png/24px-Shuriken.png?91b5e9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Shuriken.png/36px-Shuriken.png?91b5e9 1.5x, /images/thumb/Shuriken.png/48px-Shuriken.png?91b5e9 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Shuriken" title="Shuriken">Shuriken</a></span> tend to work better in long combats against <a href="/wiki/Elites" title="Elites">Elites</a> and <a href="/wiki/Bosses" title="Bosses">Bosses</a>, but weak againt common <a href="/wiki/Monsters" title="Monsters">Monsters</a>. Because of this you should also include cheaper sources of <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span> for normal combats, like <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Inflame" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Inflame" title="Inflame"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Power Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Uncommon.png?4df1e4" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Uncommon.png?4df1e4 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Inflame" title="Inflame">Inflame</a></span>, <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Vajra" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Vajra" title="Vajra"><img alt="Vajra.png" src="/images/thumb/Vajra.png/24px-Vajra.png?39bb77" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Vajra.png/36px-Vajra.png?39bb77 1.5x, /images/thumb/Vajra.png/48px-Vajra.png?39bb77 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Vajra" title="Vajra">Vajra</a></span> and <span class="inline-trigger potion-trigger" data-name="Strength Potion" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/File:StrengthPotion.png" class="image"><img alt="StrengthPotion.png" src="/images/thumb/StrengthPotion.png/24px-StrengthPotion.png?182d6f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/StrengthPotion.png/36px-StrengthPotion.png?182d6f 1.5x, /images/thumb/StrengthPotion.png/48px-StrengthPotion.png?182d6f 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strength_Potion" title="Strength Potion">Strength Potion</a></span>.
<ul><li>Some sources of <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>, like <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="J.A.X." data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/J.A.X." title="J.A.X."><img alt="CardIcon Colorless Skill Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Common.png?9ab8b5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Common.png?9ab8b5 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/J.A.X." title="J.A.X.">J.A.X.</a></span>, are useful both in short and long combats.</li></ul></li></ul>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Synergies">Synergies</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Strength?veaction=edit&amp;section=21" title="Edit section: Synergies" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Strength?action=edit&amp;section=21" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Synergies"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h3>
<ul><li>Multiplicative sources of damage, like <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Vulnerable" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable"><img alt="Icon Vulnerable.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/22px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/33px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/44px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable">Vulnerable</a></span> and <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Wrath" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Stance" title="Keywords">Wrath</a></span>, also multiplies the extra damage dealth with <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>.</li></ul>
<ul><li>Cards that hit multiple times will apply <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span> each hit. They are <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Heavy Blade" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Heavy_Blade" title="Heavy Blade"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Attack Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Common.png?260b96" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Common.png?260b96 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Heavy_Blade" title="Heavy Blade">Heavy Blade</a></span>, <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Sword Boomerang" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Sword_Boomerang" title="Sword Boomerang"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Attack Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Common.png?260b96" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Common.png?260b96 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Sword_Boomerang" title="Sword Boomerang">Sword Boomerang</a></span>, <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Twin Strike" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Twin_Strike" title="Twin Strike"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Attack Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Common.png?260b96" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Common.png?260b96 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Twin_Strike" title="Twin Strike">Twin Strike</a></span>, <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Pummel" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Pummel" title="Pummel"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Attack Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Uncommon.png?d4e46d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Uncommon.png?d4e46d 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Pummel" title="Pummel">Pummel</a></span>, <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Whirlwind" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Whirlwind" title="Whirlwind"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Attack Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Uncommon.png?d4e46d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Uncommon.png?d4e46d 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Whirlwind" title="Whirlwind">Whirlwind</a></span>, <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Fiend Fire" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Fiend_Fire" title="Fiend Fire"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Attack Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Rare.png?8ab22b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Rare.png?8ab22b 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Fiend_Fire" title="Fiend Fire">Fiend Fire</a></span>, <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Bane" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Bane" title="Bane"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Attack Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Common.png?ba66ad" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Common.png?ba66ad 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Bane" title="Bane">Bane</a></span>, <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Blade Dance" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Blade_Dance" title="Blade Dance"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Skill Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Common.png?711671" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Common.png?711671 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Blade_Dance" title="Blade Dance">Blade Dance</a></span>, <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Cloak and Dagger" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Cloak_and_Dagger" title="Cloak and Dagger"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Skill Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Common.png?711671" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Common.png?711671 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Cloak_and_Dagger" title="Cloak and Dagger">Cloak and Dagger+</a></span>, <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Dagger Spray" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Dagger_Spray" title="Dagger Spray"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Attack Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Common.png?ba66ad" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Common.png?ba66ad 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Dagger_Spray" title="Dagger Spray">Dagger Spray</a></span>, <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Endless Agony" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Endless_Agony" title="Endless Agony"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Attack Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Uncommon.png?280c75" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Uncommon.png?280c75 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Endless_Agony" title="Endless Agony">Endless Agony</a></span>, <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Eviscerate" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Eviscerate" title="Eviscerate"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Attack Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Uncommon.png?280c75" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Uncommon.png?280c75 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Eviscerate" title="Eviscerate">Eviscerate</a></span>, <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Finisher" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Finisher" title="Finisher"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Attack Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Uncommon.png?280c75" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Uncommon.png?280c75 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Finisher" title="Finisher">Finisher</a></span>, <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Flechettes" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Flechettes" title="Flechettes"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Attack Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Uncommon.png?280c75" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Uncommon.png?280c75 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Flechettes" title="Flechettes">Flechettes</a></span>, <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Riddle with Holes" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Riddle_with_Holes" title="Riddle with Holes"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Attack Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Uncommon.png?280c75" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Uncommon.png?280c75 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Riddle_with_Holes" title="Riddle with Holes">Riddle with Holes</a></span>, <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Skewer" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Skewer" title="Skewer"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Attack Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Uncommon.png?280c75" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Uncommon.png?280c75 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Skewer" title="Skewer">Skewer</a></span>, <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Glass Knife" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Glass_Knife" title="Glass Knife"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Attack Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Rare.png?c4cf3b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Rare.png?c4cf3b 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Glass_Knife" title="Glass Knife">Glass Knife</a></span>, <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Storm of Steel" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Storm_of_Steel" title="Storm of Steel"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Skill Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Rare.png?5a1724" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Rare.png?5a1724 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Storm_of_Steel" title="Storm of Steel">Storm of Steel</a></span>, <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Barrage" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Barrage" title="Barrage"><img alt="CardIcon Defect Attack Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Defect_Attack_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Defect_Attack_Common.png?c26e25" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Defect_Attack_Common.png?c26e25 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Barrage" title="Barrage">Barrage</a></span>, <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Rip and Tear" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Rip_and_Tear" title="Rip and Tear"><img alt="CardIcon Defect Attack Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Defect_Attack_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Defect_Attack_Uncommon.png?b1a937" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Defect_Attack_Uncommon.png?b1a937 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Rip_and_Tear" title="Rip and Tear">Rip and Tear</a></span>, <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Thunder Strike" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Thunder_Strike" title="Thunder Strike"><img alt="CardIcon Defect Attack Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Defect_Attack_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Defect_Attack_Rare.png?6575b9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Defect_Attack_Rare.png?6575b9 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Thunder_Strike" title="Thunder Strike">Thunder Strike</a></span>, <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Bowling Bash" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Bowling_Bash" title="Bowling Bash"><img alt="CardIcon Watcher Attack Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Watcher_Attack_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Watcher_Attack_Common.png?f67a0c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Watcher_Attack_Common.png?f67a0c 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Bowling_Bash" title="Bowling Bash">Bowling Bash</a></span>, <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Flying Sleeves" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Flying_Sleeves" title="Flying Sleeves"><img alt="CardIcon Watcher Attack Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Watcher_Attack_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Watcher_Attack_Common.png?f67a0c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Watcher_Attack_Common.png?f67a0c 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Flying_Sleeves" title="Flying Sleeves">Flying Sleeves</a></span>, <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Carve Reality" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Carve_Reality" title="Carve Reality"><img alt="CardIcon Watcher Attack Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Watcher_Attack_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Watcher_Attack_Uncommon.png?f6d4a0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Watcher_Attack_Uncommon.png?f6d4a0 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Carve_Reality" title="Carve Reality">Carve Reality</a></span>, <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Tantrum" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Tantrum" title="Tantrum"><img alt="CardIcon Watcher Attack Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Watcher_Attack_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Watcher_Attack_Uncommon.png?f6d4a0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Watcher_Attack_Uncommon.png?f6d4a0 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Tantrum" title="Tantrum">Tantrum</a></span>, <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Conjure Blade" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Conjure_Blade" title="Conjure Blade"><img alt="CardIcon Watcher Skill Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Rare.png?ae356d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Rare.png?ae356d 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Conjure_Blade" title="Conjure Blade">Conjure Blade</a></span> and <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Ragnarok" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Ragnarok" title="Ragnarok"><img alt="CardIcon Watcher Attack Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Watcher_Attack_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Watcher_Attack_Rare.png?444f95" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Watcher_Attack_Rare.png?444f95 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Ragnarok" title="Ragnarok">Ragnarok</a></span>.</li></ul>
<ul><li><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Reaper" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Reaper" title="Reaper"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Attack Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Rare.png?8ab22b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Rare.png?8ab22b 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Reaper" title="Reaper">Reaper</a></span> heals more with higher <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>.</li></ul>
<ul><li><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Wallop" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Wallop" title="Wallop"><img alt="CardIcon Watcher Attack Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Watcher_Attack_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Watcher_Attack_Uncommon.png?f6d4a0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Watcher_Attack_Uncommon.png?f6d4a0 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Wallop" title="Wallop">Wallop</a></span> <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">blocks</span></a></span> based on damage dealt.</li></ul>
<ul><li>Damage-wise, 0-cost cards such as <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Anger" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Anger" title="Anger"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Attack Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Common.png?260b96" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Common.png?260b96 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Anger" title="Anger">Anger</a></span> and <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Just Lucky" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Just_Lucky" title="Just Lucky"><img alt="CardIcon Watcher Attack Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Watcher_Attack_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Watcher_Attack_Common.png?f67a0c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Watcher_Attack_Common.png?f67a0c 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Just_Lucky" title="Just Lucky">Just Lucky</a></span> benefit from <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span> just as well as other Attacks, but their cheaper cost makes them able to apply the extra damage more often.</li></ul>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Making_temporary_effects_permanent">Making temporary effects permanent</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Strength?veaction=edit&amp;section=22" title="Edit section: Making temporary effects permanent" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Strength?action=edit&amp;section=22" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Making temporary effects permanent"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h3>
<ul><li>Temporary sources of <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span> like <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Flex" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Flex" title="Flex"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Skill Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Skill_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Skill_Common.png?e5eaaf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Skill_Common.png?e5eaaf 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Flex" title="Flex">Flex</a></span>, <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Mutagenic Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Mutagenic_Strength" title="Mutagenic Strength"><img alt="MutagenicStrength.png" src="/images/thumb/MutagenicStrength.png/24px-MutagenicStrength.png?86eb1e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/MutagenicStrength.png/36px-MutagenicStrength.png?86eb1e 1.5x, /images/thumb/MutagenicStrength.png/48px-MutagenicStrength.png?86eb1e 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Mutagenic_Strength" title="Mutagenic Strength">Mutagenic Strength</a></span> and <span class="inline-trigger potion-trigger" data-name="Flex Potion" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/File:FlexPotion.png" class="image"><img alt="FlexPotion.png" src="/images/thumb/FlexPotion.png/24px-FlexPotion.png?742e54" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/FlexPotion.png/36px-FlexPotion.png?742e54 1.5x, /images/thumb/FlexPotion.png/48px-FlexPotion.png?742e54 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Flex_Potion" title="Flex Potion">Flex Potion</a></span> work by giving you <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span> plus an equal amount of <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength Down" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength#Negative_Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon StrengthDown.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_StrengthDown.png/22px-Icon_StrengthDown.png?e0f5b9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_StrengthDown.png/33px-Icon_StrengthDown.png?e0f5b9 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_StrengthDown.png/44px-Icon_StrengthDown.png?e0f5b9 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Negative_Strength">Strength Down</a></span>. Since <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength Down" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength#Negative_Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon StrengthDown.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_StrengthDown.png/22px-Icon_StrengthDown.png?e0f5b9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_StrengthDown.png/33px-Icon_StrengthDown.png?e0f5b9 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_StrengthDown.png/44px-Icon_StrengthDown.png?e0f5b9 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Negative_Strength">Strength Down</a></span> is a <a href="/wiki/Debuff" class="mw-redirect" title="Debuff">Debuff</a>, you can use <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Artifact" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Artifact" title="Artifact"><img alt="Icon Artifact.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/22px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/33px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/44px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Artifact" title="Artifact">Artifact</a></span> or <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Orange Pellets" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orange_Pellets" title="Orange Pellets"><img alt="OrangePellets.png" src="/images/thumb/OrangePellets.png/24px-OrangePellets.png?bbb2d1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/OrangePellets.png/36px-OrangePellets.png?bbb2d1 1.5x, /images/thumb/OrangePellets.png/48px-OrangePellets.png?bbb2d1 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Orange_Pellets" title="Orange Pellets">Orange Pellets</a></span> to remove it, keeping the gained <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span> permanently.
<ul><li><span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Artifact" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Artifact" title="Artifact"><img alt="Icon Artifact.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/22px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/33px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/44px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Artifact" title="Artifact">Artifact</a></span> blocks each individual instance of <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength Down" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength#Negative_Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon StrengthDown.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_StrengthDown.png/22px-Icon_StrengthDown.png?e0f5b9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_StrengthDown.png/33px-Icon_StrengthDown.png?e0f5b9 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_StrengthDown.png/44px-Icon_StrengthDown.png?e0f5b9 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Negative_Strength">Strength Down</a></span> gained, but can also prevent <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength Down" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength#Negative_Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon StrengthDown.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_StrengthDown.png/22px-Icon_StrengthDown.png?e0f5b9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_StrengthDown.png/33px-Icon_StrengthDown.png?e0f5b9 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_StrengthDown.png/44px-Icon_StrengthDown.png?e0f5b9 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Negative_Strength">Strength Down</a></span> from working at the end of turn. Thus, if you have multiple <span class="inline-trigger potion-trigger" data-name="Flex Potion" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/File:FlexPotion.png" class="image"><img alt="FlexPotion.png" src="/images/thumb/FlexPotion.png/24px-FlexPotion.png?742e54" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/FlexPotion.png/36px-FlexPotion.png?742e54 1.5x, /images/thumb/FlexPotion.png/48px-FlexPotion.png?742e54 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Flex_Potion" title="Flex Potion">Flex Potions</a></span>, it's better that you drink all of them <b>before</b> you gain <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Artifact" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Artifact" title="Artifact"><img alt="Icon Artifact.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/22px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/33px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/44px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Artifact" title="Artifact">Artifact</a></span>. This way you can block the <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength Down" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength#Negative_Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon StrengthDown.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_StrengthDown.png/22px-Icon_StrengthDown.png?e0f5b9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_StrengthDown.png/33px-Icon_StrengthDown.png?e0f5b9 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_StrengthDown.png/44px-Icon_StrengthDown.png?e0f5b9 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Negative_Strength">Strength Down</a></span> of all potions combined with a single charge of <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Artifact" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Artifact" title="Artifact"><img alt="Icon Artifact.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/22px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/33px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/44px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Artifact" title="Artifact">Artifact</a></span>.</li></ul></li></ul>
<ul><li>Temporary sources of negative <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span> like <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Piercing Wail" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Piercing_Wail" title="Piercing Wail"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Skill Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Common.png?711671" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Common.png?711671 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Piercing_Wail" title="Piercing Wail">Piercing Wail</a></span> and <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Dark Shackles" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Dark_Shackles" title="Dark Shackles"><img alt="CardIcon Colorless Skill Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Uncommon.png?8e5796" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Uncommon.png?8e5796 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Dark_Shackles" title="Dark Shackles">Dark Shackles</a></span> work by reducing <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span> then giving an equal amount of <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Shackled" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength#Negative_Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Shackled.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Shackled.png/22px-Icon_Shackled.png?64b463" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Shackled.png/33px-Icon_Shackled.png?64b463 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Shackled.png/44px-Icon_Shackled.png?64b463 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Negative_Strength">Shackled</a></span>. Since <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Shackled" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength#Negative_Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Shackled.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Shackled.png/22px-Icon_Shackled.png?64b463" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Shackled.png/33px-Icon_Shackled.png?64b463 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Shackled.png/44px-Icon_Shackled.png?64b463 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Negative_Strength">Shackled</a></span> is a <a href="/wiki/Debuff" class="mw-redirect" title="Debuff">Debuff</a>, it can be removed if applied on the same turn an enemy is removing debuffs, making the <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span> loss permanent.
<ul><li>This trick works on <span class="enemy-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="The Champ" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/The_Champ#The_Champ" title="The Champ"><img alt="Map-Champ.png" src="/images/thumb/Map-Champ.png/22px-Map-Champ.png?8759b9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Map-Champ.png/33px-Map-Champ.png?8759b9 1.5x, /images/thumb/Map-Champ.png/44px-Map-Champ.png?8759b9 2x" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="512" /></a> <a href="/wiki/The_Champ#The_Champ" title="The Champ">The Champ</a></span> using <span class="intent-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="The Champ#Anger" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/File:Intent_Buff.png" class="image"><img alt="Intent Buff.png" src="/images/thumb/Intent_Buff.png/22px-Intent_Buff.png?935c92" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Intent_Buff.png/33px-Intent_Buff.png?935c92 1.5x, /images/thumb/Intent_Buff.png/44px-Intent_Buff.png?935c92 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a> <a href="/wiki/The_Champ" title="The Champ">Anger</a></span>, <span class="enemy-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Awakened One" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Awakened_One#Awakened_One" title="Awakened One"><img alt="Map-Awakened.png" src="/images/thumb/Map-Awakened.png/22px-Map-Awakened.png?bfea9f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Map-Awakened.png/33px-Map-Awakened.png?bfea9f 1.5x, /images/thumb/Map-Awakened.png/44px-Map-Awakened.png?bfea9f 2x" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="512" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Awakened_One#Awakened_One" title="Awakened One">Awakened One</a></span> using <span class="intent-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Awakened One#Rebirth" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/File:Intent_Unknown.png" class="image"><img alt="Intent Unknown.png" src="/images/thumb/Intent_Unknown.png/22px-Intent_Unknown.png?ef3f5c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Intent_Unknown.png/33px-Intent_Unknown.png?ef3f5c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Intent_Unknown.png/44px-Intent_Unknown.png?ef3f5c 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Awakened_One" title="Awakened One">Rebirth</a></span> and <span class="enemy-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Time Eater" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Time_Eater#Time_Eater" title="Time Eater"><img alt="Map-TimeEater.png" src="/images/thumb/Map-TimeEater.png/22px-Map-TimeEater.png?74ceb5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Map-TimeEater.png/33px-Map-TimeEater.png?74ceb5 1.5x, /images/thumb/Map-TimeEater.png/44px-Map-TimeEater.png?74ceb5 2x" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="512" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Time_Eater#Time_Eater" title="Time Eater">Time Eater</a></span> using <span class="intent-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Time Eater#Haste" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/File:Intent_Buff.png" class="image"><img alt="Intent Buff.png" src="/images/thumb/Intent_Buff.png/22px-Intent_Buff.png?935c92" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Intent_Buff.png/33px-Intent_Buff.png?935c92 1.5x, /images/thumb/Intent_Buff.png/44px-Intent_Buff.png?935c92 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Time_Eater" title="Time Eater">Haste</a></span>.</li>
<li>This does <b>not</b> work when <span class="enemy-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Corrupt Heart" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Corrupt_Heart#Corrupt_Heart" title="Corrupt Heart"><img alt="Map-CorruptHeart.png" src="/images/thumb/Map-CorruptHeart.png/22px-Map-CorruptHeart.png?9f6024" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Map-CorruptHeart.png/33px-Map-CorruptHeart.png?9f6024 1.5x, /images/thumb/Map-CorruptHeart.png/44px-Map-CorruptHeart.png?9f6024 2x" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="512" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Corrupt_Heart#Corrupt_Heart" title="Corrupt Heart">Corrupt Heart</a></span> is using <span class="intent-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Corrupt Heart#Buff" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/File:Intent_Buff.png" class="image"><img alt="Intent Buff.png" src="/images/thumb/Intent_Buff.png/22px-Intent_Buff.png?935c92" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Intent_Buff.png/33px-Intent_Buff.png?935c92 1.5x, /images/thumb/Intent_Buff.png/44px-Intent_Buff.png?935c92 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Corrupt_Heart" title="Corrupt Heart">Buff</a></span>, because it doesn't remove debuffs, only negative <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span>. In fact, the <span class="enemy-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Corrupt Heart" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Corrupt_Heart#Corrupt_Heart" title="Corrupt Heart"><img alt="Map-CorruptHeart.png" src="/images/thumb/Map-CorruptHeart.png/22px-Map-CorruptHeart.png?9f6024" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Map-CorruptHeart.png/33px-Map-CorruptHeart.png?9f6024 1.5x, /images/thumb/Map-CorruptHeart.png/44px-Map-CorruptHeart.png?9f6024 2x" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="512" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Corrupt_Heart#Corrupt_Heart" title="Corrupt Heart">Corrupt Heart</a></span> will only end up <i>stronger</i> as the <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Shackled" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength#Negative_Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Shackled.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Shackled.png/22px-Icon_Shackled.png?64b463" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Shackled.png/33px-Icon_Shackled.png?64b463 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Shackled.png/44px-Icon_Shackled.png?64b463 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Negative_Strength">Shackled</a></span> remains while the negative <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span> doesn't.</li></ul></li></ul>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Achievements">Achievements</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Strength?veaction=edit&amp;section=23" title="Edit section: Achievements" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Strength?action=edit&amp;section=23" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Achievements"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="JAXXED">JAXXED</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Strength?veaction=edit&amp;section=24" title="Edit section: JAXXED" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Strength?action=edit&amp;section=24" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: JAXXED"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h3>
<ul><li>Unlocks when <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Strength</a></span> reaches <b>50</b> or more during combat.</li></ul>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Update_History">Update History</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Strength?veaction=edit&amp;section=25" title="Edit section: Update History" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Strength?action=edit&amp;section=25" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Update History"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
<ul><li><b>Weekly Patch 51 - Recursion</b>
<ul><li>Fixed issue where Jaxxed achievement was obtained when enemies gained 50 Strength.</li>
<li>Negative Strength power typo fix.</li></ul></li>
<li><b>Weekly Patch 50 - The Final Act</b>
<ul><li>Red Skull relic's Strength gain is now correctly applied to the cards in your hand at start of combats.</li></ul></li>
<li><b>Weekly Patch 48 - Creative AI</b>
<ul><li>Certain enemies no longer gain extra strength when removing Piercing Wail or Dark Shackles from themselves.</li></ul></li>
<li><b>Weekly Patch 44 - Chrysalis</b>
<ul><li>Hotfix - BUG FIX - Red Skull relic now correctly loses bonus strength when healing above 50% HP.</li></ul></li>
<li><b>Weekly Patch 42 - Reboot</b>
<ul><li>Fixed issue where upgraded card from Warped Tongs wasn't showing the correct value if you had Strength/Dexterity.</li></ul></li>
<li><b>Weekly Patch 22 - Testing the Third Character</b>
<ul><li>Localization - Strength and Dexterity power can now properly utilize localized periods.</li></ul></li>
<li><b>Weekly Patch 6 - We're Back!</b>
<ul><li>Corpse Explosion is now affected by Powers (Vulnerable, Strength, Pen Nib, etc).</li></ul></li>
<li><b>Weekly Patch 2 - Slimes!</b>
<ul><li>Strength and Dexterity now cap at 999 and -999.</li></ul></li></ul>
